Daisuke (Cursed Singing Lech)
=============================

*"This -- this is totally cramping my style! I have to find that old bag fast!"*

*A shallow celebrity singer cursed to transform into a rabbit at a woman's romantic touch.*

**Background**

A wealthy, womanizing pop idol, Daisuke rudely dismissed an
elderly fan who asked for an autograph -- and she cursed him on
the spot. Now any woman's amorous touch turns him into a
handsome black rabbit until he escapes her sight, clothes and
all left behind. Chastened but hardly reformed, he's determined
to track the old woman down and get the curse lifted.

**Personality**

Lecherous, self-absorbed, and far too famous for his own good,
Daisuke's biggest problems are entirely of his own making -- when
he isn't chasing girls, he's complaining about his food.

